{"generated":"2026-11-10T04:15:55.118Z","tz":"America/Los_Angeles","hours":48,"headline":"BOMB DEFUSE learns to defuse itself","lede":"WATCH batch 12 lands on the two-hand defusal title: press Y and the solver crew that clears all three bombs in the harness takes both seats — until the moment you touch a key.","notes":[{"tag":"w","text":"BOMB DEFUSE is the 50th title with a WATCH seat. Y (or the WATCH pill) hands both seats to solvePads — SYNC keys turn together, blades cycle onto the lit color, the bar pins before the needle seats. Any input takes your hand back mid-run."},{"tag":"h","text":"The seat is honest by construction: solvePads verifies every action against live integer state, so re-seating anywhere mid-run replays the real driver, never a canned route. The pilot mutation-proves it — cut the solver's seat supply and both advance legs go red with an idle crew scoring nothing."},{"tag":"k","text":"Online stays wire-governed: Y no-ops in a linked room — your partner, not a script, is the guide there. The attract screen already self-plays the same solver, so the title screen is the demo."},{"tag":"w","text":"Batch 13 triage filed on #1637: SpaceInvaders needs a proven solver before a seat; CometDriftHD, FireCrew and Minesweeper have solve hooks worth checking next."}],"notesFrom":"2026-11-10T04:15:55.118Z","notesCarried":false,"look":[],"strips":[],"stats":{"merged":{"total":3,"builder":2,"qa":1,"ops":0,"slots":{"a":0,"b":0,"both":2,"unknown":0}},"issues":{"closed":9,"opened":7},"overnight":0,"medianMergeMin":12},"rows":[["11-07T21",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-07T22",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-07T23",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T00",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T01",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T02",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T03",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T04",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T05",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T06",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T07",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T08",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T09",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-